{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です(*'ω'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋に握手会に行ったときみんなで名古屋名物を食べに行きました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願の味噌串カツ〜〜〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4H4P4BA0SHKE8S6ZFA6SH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(左に写ってる手はさりなちゃんです♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初の味噌串カツ食べました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目はあんこがついてるのかな？と言う感じでした！\n味は美味しい〜〜〜〜初めての味でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあ、とろけました♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4H5M6HF7FNPW2Q6ZV4YZ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手羽先も食べました〜〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋といえば手羽先ですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ方もあって上手にできてうれしかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4H6WNGQN5QRVE1S614EN8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとあとどて煮とか手羽餃子とか不思議な卵焼きとか〜いっぱいいろいろ忘れちゃうくらい食べました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回のごはん会は珍しく？まなふぃーがハッチャケていてとても面白かったです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天然なまなふぃーを見て笑ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなまなふぃーの写真はありません。。。\nが、私の目の前に座ってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、ほんとにまなふぃーツボだった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4H83NDSMH5X2N6RFRSJAF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※持っているものは烏龍お茶です。※"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何かと写真NGが多い私の推しメンさりなちゃんです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真何でもかんでもだめだめだめ〜〜って言ってなかなか載せられないところも可愛すぎて大好きです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりなちゃんの可愛さ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒しです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気が出ないときはさりなちゃんに可愛い〜〜って言って遊びます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく反応してくれるので元気出ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女にしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな子が毎日家で待ってたら幸せになれそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ただいまーーー』\n【お帰り♡ごはんできてるよー？？】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【美味しいー？？\nねえねえ美味しくないのー？今日はねこれいれて、あれいれて、それでね！ねえねえちゃんと美味しい？美味しくないのかな？(● ˃̶͈̀ロ˂̶͈́)੭ꠥ⁾⁾】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ごめんごめん今美味しすぎて食べるのに夢中だった』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【よかった〜〜ねえ、今日新しい服買ったの！似合ってる？ねえねえねえ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『何着ても可愛いよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【うるさい〜〜ちゃんとみて〜〜もーう(//∇//)】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",